{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113304","id":3055292285,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62HA99","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113304","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113304.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113304.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113304","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113304/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113304/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113304/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8a8490bd2ea903a3ed1f13c21e396c0c72736814","number":113304,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement XeGTAO (and also VBAO)","user":{"login":"HydrogenC","id":33123710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIzNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33123710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC","html_url":"https://github.com/HydrogenC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A rework of #110997 (see [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110997#pullrequestreview-3380236752) and [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110997#issuecomment-3448156969)). Now the implementation is a full adaptation from XeGTAO, and the codebase is completely decoupled from ASSAO and independent. \r\n\r\nShowcase: \r\n![f47b2aa5856d6cdf4d156a30597dcb13](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c26351a-0630-4edc-a56b-943238e97c10)\r\n\r\n## Implementation details\r\nA full port of the XeGTAO gather and blur passes, with the following differences: Godot uses a de-interleaved depth buffer and half resolution intermediate images whilst XeGTAO uses full resolution images. So I took the interleave pass from ASSAO to restore the half resolution image back to full res. \r\n\r\n## Possible questions\r\n### Q: Why still keep ASSAO as an option? \r\nA: Keeping ASSAO and making the mode togglable will make the comparing of different AO effects easier during the dev phase. GTAO (or specifically XeGTAO) is recommended to work with TAA, whereas ASSAO doesn't have such requirements. Also, since the current GTAO implementation is parallel to ASSAO, it would be easy to remove ASSAO and switch completely to GTAO if required. \r\n### Q: Why not GT-VBAO? \r\nA: Here's another branch that implements GT-VBAO on top of changes from this PR: <https://github.com/HydrogenC/godot/tree/vbao-neo>. It's possible that that branch rather than this branch would be adopted at last. And here's the preview: \r\n![微信图片_20251129121834_154_49](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6597f38-15a7-4cdd-a04c-58c9e9763c58)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Future works\r\nThese works are mostly chores not done yet and has to be done, but I prefer to do them after the content of this PR gets approval: \r\n - [ ] Expose thickness parameter as a editor param\r\n - [ ] Write docs","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","defau